      },
      "message": "fix(data): remove incorrect conflict between Svadu and Svade extensions\n\nSvadu and Svade should be able to coexist:\n\n1. The RISC-V spec does not indicate these extensions are incompatible\n2. The RVB23S64 profile requires Svade (mandatory) and allows Svadu (optional)\n3. The Linux kernel device tree documentation explicitly handles all four\n   combinations of these extensions being present or absent\n\nThe previous `not` constraints in both extension files were incorrect and\nprevented valid configurations like RVB23S64 from being expressed.\n\nAlso fixed typo: \"defintion\" -> \"definition\" in comments.\n\nCloses #1217",
